{"availability":"available","full":"Partha-dev01/AutiSense","name":"AutiSense","description":"AI-Enabled Early Autism Screening, Diagnosis Support & Post-Diagnosis Care Platform ","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":9,"forks":0,"created":"2026-03-01T07:45:32Z","updated":"2026-09-15T15:34:19Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://autisense.imaginaerium.in","topics":[],"demo":"https://autisense.imaginaerium.in/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:32:59.710Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-03T14:32:59.710Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-03T14:32:59.710Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:32:59.710Z","stars":9,"forks":0}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Your video never leaves your device. The pose and behavior analysis runs locally in your browser.","### ⚠️ Not a medical or diagnostic tool AutiSense is a screening and educational aid only. It is not a diagnostic device, and it has not been clinically validated. It cannot diagnose autism or any other condition, and its results must never replace assessment by a qualified clinician. The on-device models flag behavioral patterns that should be interpreted by a professional. If you have concerns about a child's development, please consult a healthcare provider. See Ethics & privacy."],"features":["🔒 On-device screening inference — pose + behavior models run in your browser","via ONNX Runtime Web (WebGPU with a WASM fallback), inside a Web Worker. Video stays on your device.","🕺 Pose-based movement screening — a YOLO pose model extracts COCO-17 body","keypoints; a Temporal Convolutional Network (TCN) classifies a 64-frame window into movement categories.","🧒 Guided intake flow — a multi-step activity sequence (consent, device"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Partha-dev01/AutiSense/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"5d2b6e1e91555b25aeab91c14c0ad1cfe8b8c2763db29f25b920d77e91602339","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T06:26:16.975Z"},"overviewChe